    "detailed_description": "Check also these game:<br><br><br><br><strong>The world is dead. You are being hunted.</strong><br><br>The chaos will never end. Decimate your enemies, fight against hordes of invaders who know no mercy. Dozens of enemy types await you. Old comrades will stand in your way. Shoot first and never ask questions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520430/extras/be53ca2410f37769703e80606f461c42.poster.avif?t=1704623873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520430/extras/be53ca2410f37769703e80606f461c42.webm?t=1704623873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520430/extras/be53ca2410f37769703e80606f461c42.mp4?t=1704623873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Tools of destruction.</strong><br><br>Choose your tools of destruction from more than ten available weapons. Additional will be available for each of them, hidden in levels as a prize for the explorers. Add a grenade launcher to your machine gun.  Do net let the enemy stand in your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520430/extras/affaa26e7c72db6e611e9fd92ed4b76a.poster.avif?t=1704623873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520430/extras/affaa26e7c72db6e611e9fd92ed4b76a.webm?t=1704623873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520430/extras/affaa26e7c72db6e611e9fd92ed4b76a.mp4?t=1704623873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Interact with the world.</strong><br><br>Use every tool to hurt your enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im